# No domain of your own? Use the free sslip.io trick: if your VPS's public IP
# is 123.45.67.89, use "123-45-67-89.sslip.io" here — it's a real public DNS
# name that resolves to your IP, so Caddy can still get a real Let's Encrypt
# certificate for it automatically. No account or setup needed on your end.
